{
  "label": "Trash Bins",
  "tagline": "Rummage through town bins for scraps, and stash goods in them for others to find",
  "category": "World",
  "description": "Players search trash bins in every town for random loot, with a cooldown per bin so nobody can farm one. Each bin is also a small shared storage anyone can open, good for dead drops and stashes. Bins can be placed by hand or picked up automatically from the bins already in the world.",
